
  bukka-api-1 · Bukka API server (BUK-45)
  ─────────────────────────────────────────
  API code      /opt/bukka/api
  Settings      /etc/bukka/api.env   (sudo to read or edit)
  Data today    /var/lib/bukka/bukka.db  (SQLite, on this server's disk)

  bukka-api status | restart | logs   manage the API
  bukka-api migrate                   create or update the tables (alembic upgrade head)
  bukka-api seed                      load the demo restaurants
  psql "<url>"                        PostgreSQL client, to test a connection

